title: "BioLaserTwin: Simulation and Inverse Modeling of Fabry-Perot Cavity Lasing with Model Discrepancy in Thioflavin T-Based Amyloid Analysis"
message: "If you use BioLaserTwin-CPC in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
