  - "Bayesian approximation error"
  - "conformal prediction"
abstract: >-
  Standalone release of BioLaserTwin accompanying the Computer Physics
  Communications (CPiP) manuscript. Provides a 16x-oversampled gain-loaded Airy
  cavity simulator strictly isolated from reduced-order inverse solvers,
  observable extraction, Fisher/DoE identifiability, BAE-corrected PIELM,
  neural baselines, and split-conformal uncertainty quantification.
